    "committer": "Wanding Zhou <zhouw3@email.chop.edu>",
    "message": "1.31.2: docs review fixes; Zenodo fallback survives a slow link\n\n- vignette: the setup chunk also caches genomeInfo.hg38, Mammal40.address\n  and probeIDSignature, so the probe and annotation examples run on a new\n  install; the sentence about a decoy option that no longer exists is gone\n- metadata.csv: EPIC.5.SigDF.normal described as what it holds (PrEC.Rep1,\n  PrEC.Rep2, NAF.A, NAF.B, NAF.C), not an LNCaP segmentation\n- the Zenodo fallback (titles with no hub id, e.g. HM450.address) downloads\n  to a temp file with a 600 s timeout; R's 60 s default cut the 8 MB file\n  short on a slow link and broke check examples and vignette builds\n",
    "time": 1792980469
  },
